    "body": "PRs to fix this are welcome, the wix manifest is located in `install/windows/main.wxs`.\r\nThough hopefully winget will be fixing this down the road from their end, because in the winget manifest the installer type is specifically defined as wix and not as msi. After all, wix and ordinary msi seem to have other differences that winget explicitly handles. But following standards sounds good either way.",
